00270", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974869_901028401633603_627257832616781480_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sfLaDvm-ZDUQ7kNvwEx1d8W&_nc_oc=Adm1dmeOjqC9LaEhKBzEHL9xbZ576dx9YxKUQwKnAv_K2yqcBnbp4iyZifdcVCocFRg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftmZ7dEk7w_68CV3VC-8QK6VaMq1RIV-Khif10Se9A_vg&oe=69986D1F"}, {"file_name": "VRTherapy_Cam_Sensory1_3840x2160 (Custom).png", "id": "985952625960516", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75254875_985952629293849_7550419092568334009_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EA6PmW8_qGoQ7kNvwEs01Ff&_nc_oc=AdlRm5jVEhUdD1FjDCvm4-wgHs0TUmQT5jBMmE4LXQeWqdUGpzdstQzFzaKqSTopw-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsO9CVQLCyR2cT1Km8f9QTt1eASGyuKI_svGx10vB-q0g&oe=69986120"}, {"file_name": "VRTherapy_Cam_Sensory_Wide_3840x2160 (Custom).png", "id": "3552569408344767", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031495_3552569411678100_5955106357745012263_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wdnRT6vbiloQ7kNvwFKlQC7&_nc_oc=AdnqCeZQHjkLe7QNWEwsrWZnqOS-ddNad0pcxfr_arfH51IhjGZtqagF9VYiLbIbG-I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsM7nZfSz52gvw_K29195ZJuU-Zolq3x4HY0bv6Xh6z1g&oe=69985275"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover-art_landscape.png", "id": "862962371915225", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982538_862962375248558_5129333378553841424_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PN4znTEeZK8Q7kNvwG-3ni1&_nc_oc=AdnOD9n1nymMVyJAvyF7R2WOc42a0LzDHiASSuoaEk78U0s4a1Tj0W3Tg00UdphDCI4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu64e9p5afPlqok-mMQ94za8nHbO2MoKEQhV77nY1eVKQ&oe=699843CA"}, "display_name": "Sensory Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Imagine if you could be instantly transported to a magical, calming world. \n\n\ud83c\udfb6 \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f A place where you could let go of everyday stresses and be soothed by relaxing visuals, tactile sensations and gentle sounds.\n\nNOW YOU CAN!\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Inspired by the many hundreds of real-life Sensory Rooms in the world, Your VR Therapy now makes it possible to experience these important relaxation facilities virtually.\n\nAnd for a tiny fraction of the cost.\n\n**WHAT ARE SENSORY ROOMS?**\nThese are widely used to help people with stress issues and learning difficulties. They offer a safe space to unwind and engage in gently stimulating activities.\n\n**OUR VIRTUAL SENSORY ROOM **\nFrom the comfort of your home, you can now enter a realm of relaxation and sensory exploration \u2013 instantly. \n\nCreated in collaboration with trained Sensory Room experts, our space offers:\n\n\u2013 CALMING VISUALS -- \n\n\u2013 SOOTHING SOUNDS \u2013\n\n\u2013 INTERACTIVE OBJECTS \u2013\n\nWhich all help to promote comfort and self-discovery.\n\nThis virtual oasis has been developed for both adults and their family members in need of some safe, relaxing 'me' time.\n\nIt offers a rare opportunity to step away from the stresses of everyday life.\n\nOur highly interactive app:\n- Enables you to let off steam in a secure, controlled environment.\n- Promotes individual play and discovery.\n- Is designed by experts to enhance emotional development.\n- Requires no travel to a physical location.\n\nSTART YOUR RELAXATION TODAY!", "short_description": "Your VR Therapy's virtual Sensory Room is a highly interactive and engaging alternative to expensive real-world Sensory Rooms, which are widely used in both clinical and educational settings.\n\nOur expertly-designed VR space allows you to enter a calming virtual room and embark on a journey of relaxation in your own home.\n\nDownload today and discover this revolutionary new way of enjoying the Sensory Room experience with zero fuss, travel or ongoing expense."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.yourvrtherapy.com/app-privacy-policy", "develo